    <string name="set_about">About</string>
    <string name="about_title">X-tract 26.1.5</string>
    <string name="about_text">A local media downloader for X posts. Downloaded files and library data stay on this device.</string>
    <string name="privacy_title">Privacy</string>
    <string name="privacy_text">Without signing in, the app uses no login, cookies or account access: it contacts X\'s public embed service to read post media and, only if enabled above, the FxTwitter fallback, sending only the post link. If you choose to sign in, you do it on x.com itself; the app keeps only the two session cookies X issues, encrypted on this device, and sends them only to x.com and only for posts that can\'t be read publicly. Only download content you have the right to save.</string>

